1 NAME Niels /Valdemarsøn/
2 GIVN Niels
2 _MARNM Valdemarsøn
2 NICK Niels
2 NICK Count of Halland
1 NAME Niels Valdemarsen, Count of Halland
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE BET 1188 AND 1199
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1218
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Sverige
1 OCCU Greve Halland, Graf of Halland
1 TITL Greve af Nørre Halland
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://finnholbek.dk/genealogy/getperson.php?personID=I28252&tree=2
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Niels Valdemarsson, Duke of Halland
2 CONT
2 CONT Reference
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p10547.htm#i105463
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Niels var faderns oäkte son. Han blev hertig av Halland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Nedan från http://www.genealogie-mittelalter.de/Niels I.Graf von Halland (1216-1218/19)Graf von Schwerin-Wittenburg<nowiki>----------------------------</nowiki> 1218/19Einziger Sohn des Königs Waldemar II. der Sieger von Dänemark 
2 CONC aus seiner 1. Ehe mit Richza von Sachsen, Tochter von Herzog Heinrich dem Löwenum 1217/18oo Ida von Schwerin, Tochter und Erbin von Günzel II. zu Wittenburg-Kinder:Niels II.- 1251
2 CONT
2 CONT Nedan frånhttp://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/DENMARK.htm#SvendSvendsendied1097NIELS Valdemarsen (-[1218/19]). 
2 CONT
2 CONT The Annales Ryenses name "Nicolao filio illegitimo [Waldemari Regis]" specifying that his father granted him "comitatum Hallandiæ"[449]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Count of Halland 1218. m (1217) ODA von Schwerin, daughter of GÜNZEL II Graf von Schwerin & his wife Oda --- (-[1218/19]). Heiress of ½ Schwerin.a) NIELS ([1218]-1251, bur Sorø). Count of Halland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT The Annales Ryenses record the death in 1251 of "comes Nicolaus"[450]. m as her first husband, CECILIE Jensdatter [Galen], daughter of JENS Jakobsen [Galen] & his wife Adelheid Gräfin von Dassel. She married secondly (1252) R. And
2 CONC ers Olufsen [Glug] (-1270).i) NIELS (-1271).ii) ANDERS.iii) JAKOB (-1308). 
2 CONT
2 CONT The Annales Lubicenses record that "Iacobus" obtained the "cometiam Hallandiæ" in 1283[451]. Count of Halland.(a) NIELS III (-murdered 1314). Count of Halland.(b) VALDEMAR (-murdered 1314). Count of Halland.(c) EUPHEMIA . m HENNIN
2 CONC G I von Putbus (-1351/2).iv) CÆCILIA . m TYGE Thorstensen.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.danbbs.dk/~stst/slaegt_adel/halland.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Name: Niels av Halland
2 CONT
2 CONT Sex: M
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 1218/19
2 CONT
2 CONT Reference Number: gorm 192
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: Nevnes som greve av Halland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Valdemar II Sejr b: 28 JUN 1170 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: *ukjent utenomekteskapelig
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Oda von Schwerin
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: CA. 1217
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT  Niels II av Halland b: CA. 1218
2 CONT
2 CONT Kilde: http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=4l83jmr3&id=I81
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Niels Valdemarsen, Count of Halland, Nikolaus, (died 1218) was Count of Halland from 1216 until his death in 1218. He was a natural son of King Valdemar II of Denmark by an unknown mistress.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1217, Niels married Oda of Schwerin, a daughter of Gunzelin I, Count of Schwerin. As a result of the marriage, half the county of Schwerin was pledged as security to Niels until her dowry could be paid.
2 CONT
2 CONT Niels died already in 1218, his widow in 1220. They were survived by a son, Niels, Count of Northern Halland. Disputes over his claims to the German territories pledged to his father, led to the capture of his grandfather Valdemar
2 CONC  II in 1223 by Henry, Count of Schwerin.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bibliography
2 CONT
2 CONT Johannes Steenstrup: "Niels, Greve af Halland", Dansk biografisk leksikon, XII. Bind. Münch-Peirup, 1898, p. 202.
