2 CONT HERMANN von Hengebach (-after 11 Feb 1124).  Friedrich [I] Archbishop of Köln donated revenue to Köln St Cunibert by charter dated 11 Feb 1124 witnessed by "Gerhart de Gulecho, Gerhart de Hostathe, Godefrit de Mere, Hereman de Hei
2 CONC ngebach, Thederihc de Gladebach, Heriman advocatus urbis…"[1649].  Friedrich [I] Archbishop of Köln founded a church "in castro meo episcopali…Zulpiacum" by charter dated 1124 witnessed by "Paganus comes, Theodericus comes de Ara,
2 CONC  Herimannus de Hengebach, Theodericus et frater eius Adelgerus de Gladebach…"[1650]. 
2 CONT Internal Sourcing: 
2 CONT [1649] Niederrheins Urkundenbuch, Band I, 298, p. 195. 
2 CONT [1650] Niederrheins Urkundenbuch, Band I, 299, p. 195. 
