2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Prince of the House of Ascania.  Count of Anhalt and Ballenstedt.  Lord of Bienburg.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1180 he becomes Duke of Saxony as either Bernard 1st or Bernard 3rd.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marries Brigette (Jutta) of Denmark.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marries Sophia of Thuringia upon Brigette's demise.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marries Judith (Judyta), daughter of Mieszco the 1st, Duke of All Poland and former House enemy.
2 CONT
