3 CONT
3 CONT -------------------- Prince of the House of Ascania. Count of Anhalt and Ballenstedt. Lord of Bienburg.
3 CONT
3 CONT In 1180 he becomes Duke of Saxony as either Bernard 1st or Bernard 3rd.
3 CONT
3 CONT Marries Brigette (Jutta) of Denmark.
3 CONT
3 CONT Marries Sophia of Thuringia upon Brigette's demise.
3 CONT
3 CONT Marries Judith (Judyta), daughter of Mieszco the 1st, Duke of All Poland and former House enemy.
3 CONT
