1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Killed at the Battle of Aussig in Bohemia, along with some 500 Saxon and Thuringian aristocrats who were sent by the Pope to fight the Hussites who posed a threat to Catholicism. They were massacred. The Hussites w
2 CONC on in the end, after years of wars, with Protestantism taking over as the main religion in Saxony, Thuringia and Bohemia. 
