1 NOTE     ES 11:2;PED OF AUGUSTINE H. AYERS
1 NOTE OR "FLORENCE"; COUNT OF HOLLAND
1 NOTE His descendant, Florent, Count of Holland, was a competitor for the crown in 1291-1292.
