1 OCCU Markgreve av Meißen 1156-1190, Markgreve i Meissen, ЈЈООЙЙЇЇЇ(+21Ї)Й ЌЮЯЬӔӁ, Otto Markgraf von Meißen
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Otto Markgraf von Meißen (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #113947, b. circa 1125, d. 18 February 1190
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=20 Jan 2003
2 CONT
2 CONT      Otto Markgraf von Meißen was born circa 1125. He was the son of Conrad Markgraf von Meißen and Luitgarde von Swabia. He married Hedwig von Brandenburg, daughter of Albrecht I Markgraf von Brandenburg and Sophie von Wizenburg,
2 CONC  after 1159. He died on 18 February 1190.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Otto Markgraf von Meißen also went by the nick-name of Otto von. He gained the title of Markgraf von Meißen in 1156. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Otto Markgraf von Meißen and Hedwig von Brandenburg
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Sophie von Meißen
2 CONT
2 CONT -2. Adelheid von Meißen+ (1) d. 1 Feb 1211
2 CONT
2 CONT -3. Albrecht Markgraf von Meißen+ b. 1158, d. 25 Jun 1195
2 CONT
2 CONT -4. Dietrich Markgraf von Meißen+ b. c 1162, d. 17 Feb 1221
2 CONT
