1 NOTE MARGRAVE OF MEISSEN; KNOWN AS "THE RICH"
1 NOTE Otto II (1125 - 18 February 1190) was the Margrave of Meissen from 1157 until his death in 1190. His father was Conrad the Great and his son was Dietrich I, Margrave of Meissen.
