2 CONT Albrecht Markgraf von Meißen (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #113945, b. 1158, d. 25 June 1195 
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=22 Jun 2003 
2 CONT
2 CONT Albrecht Markgraf von Meißen was born in 1158. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Otto Markgraf von Meißen and Hedwig von Brandenburg. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Sophie of Bohemia, daughter of Friedrich, King of Bohemia and Elisabeth Arpád, on 23 April 1186 at Aussig. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 25 June 1195. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Albrecht Markgraf von Meißen also went by the nick-name of Albrecht 'the Proud'. He succeeded to the title of Markgraf von Meißen in 1190. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Albrecht Markgraf von Meißen and Sophie of Bohemia 
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Christine von Meißen d. a 1251
