1 NOTE Anna, Margravine von Brandenburg (27 August  1487 , Berlin û3 May  1514 , Kiel ) was a German  noblewoman . 
2 CONT <br />
2 CONT She was the daughter of Johann Cicero , Elector of Brandenburg  and Margarethe of Saxony . At age 15, on 10 April  1502  she married King Frederick I of Denmark . They had two children: Christian III of Denmark  (12 August  1503  
2 CONC û 1 January  1559 ) Dorothea (1 August  1504  û 11 April  1547 ), married 1 July  1526  to Duke Albert of Prussia . She died in 1514 at age 26. Her husband remarried, to Sophie of Pomerania , and had six more children.
