1 NAME Lothar II von Stade
2 GIVN Lothar II
2 NSFX von Stade
1 SEX M
1 DEAT
2 DATE 5 SEP 929
2 PLAC near Lenzen an der Elbe
2 ADDR
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} LOTHAR [I] von Stade, son of --- (-killed in battle near Ebstorf 2 Feb 880).  Graf von Stade.  The Gesta Francorum lists "Liutharium" as one of the twelve counts who were killed fighting the Danes in 880[1804]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT m ---.   The name of Lothar's wife is not known. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Graf Lothar [I] & his wife had [one] child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT >1.         '''[LOTHAR [II] von Stade (-killed in battle near Lenzen an der Elbe 5 Sep 929).  No proof has been found that Lothar [II] was the son of Lothar [I] but this looks likely.  Thietmar records the death of two of his grea
2 CONC t grandfathers "both named Liuthar" at the battle of Lenzen 5 Sep[1805].]  m SWANEHILD, daughter of --- (-13 Dec-).  The primary source which confirms her marriage has not yet been identified.   Graf Lothar [II] & his wife had fou
2 CONC r children:''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>a)         HEINRICH [I] "der Kahle" von Stade (-11 May 976, bur Kloster Heeringen).  The paternity of Heinrich is determined from Thietmar recording the death of two of his great grandfathers "both named Liuthar" at the battle o
2 CONC f Lenzen 5 Sep[1806].  Graf von Stade.  He constructed Burg Harsefeld in 964. 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>b)         GERBURG von Stade .  The primary source which confirms her parentage has not yet been identified. 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>c)         SIEGFRIED [I] von Stade .  The primary source which confirms his parentage has not yet been identified.  Graf von Stade 954/973.  "Otto…rex" granted property "Asundorf marcam et Dornsteti marcam Liubissa…in pago Hassi
2 CONC geuui in comitatu comitis Sigiuuridi…loco Biscopstat…in pago Altgeuui in comitatu comitis Uuillihelmi" to "vassallo Billing" by charter dated 23 Apr 961[1807]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>d)         THIETMAR von Stade (-12 Mar 1001).  The primary source which confirms his parentage has not yet been identified.  Abbot of Corvey 983. 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SAXON%20NOBILITY.htm#_Toc509136503
2 CONT ----
