2 CONT
2 CONT '''Swanehild''' (or '''Swanhild'''). Her ancestry is unknown. She might have been a daughter of:
2 CONT
2 CONT * [http://www.geni.com/people/Eberhard-Graaf-van-Hamaland/6000000012941861395 Eberhard van Hamalant]
2 CONT
2 CONT * [http://www.geni.com/people/Count-of-hamalant-Wichman-I-Hamalant/6000000022892091463 Wichman van Hamalant]
2 CONT
2 CONT Her birth and death dates are guesses. The only thing that is known for sure is that she died on December 13, probably in the early 900s. Ref: Europäische Stammtafeln, one of the standard authorities on medieval lines.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Leo van de Pas: Europäische Stammtafeln, J.A. Stargardt Verlag, Marburg, Schwennicke, Detlev (Ed.), Reference: VIII 133. http://www.genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00201291&tree=LEO
