2 CONC ted 29 May 992[327].  The necrology of Fulda records the death in 992 of "Heribraht com"[328].  m IMIZA [Irmintrudis], daughter of MEGINGOZ Graf & his wife Gerberge [Matfriede] ([950/60]-).  The Vita Adelheidis names "Irminthrudis
