2 CONT From the English Wikipedia page on Bernard I Duke of Saxony:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bernard_I,_Duke_of_Saxony
2 CONT
2 CONT Bernard I (c. 950–9 February 1011) was the duke of Saxony (973–1011), the second of the Billung dynasty, a son of Duke Herman and Oda. He extended his father's power considerably.
2 CONT
2 CONT He fought the Danes in 974, 983, and 994 during their invasions. He supported the succession of Otto III over Henry the Wrangler. In 986, he was made marshal and in 991 and 995 he joined the young Otto on campaign against the Slav
2 CONC s. He increased his power vis-à-vis the crown, where his father had been the representative of the king to the tribe, Bernard was the representative of the tribe to the king [1]. Bernard died in 1011 and was buried in the Church o
2 CONC f Saint Michael in Lüneburg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family
2 CONT
2 CONT In 990, Bernard married Hildegard (d. 1011), daughter of Count Henry I the Bald of Stade (d. 976). They had the following issue:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Herman, died young
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Bernard II, his successor
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Thietmar, a count, died in a duel on 1 April 1048 in Pöhlde
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Gedesdiu (or Gedesti) (died 30 June c. 1040), abbess of Metelen (from 993) and Herford (from 1002)
2 CONT
2 CONT and probably:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Matilda, nun
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Othelindis (died 9 March 1044), married Dirk III of Holland
2 CONT
2 CONT Bernard I, Duke of Saxony
2 CONT
2 CONT House of Billung
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: ca. 950 
2 CONT
2 CONT Died: 9 February 1011 in Corvey
2 CONT
2 CONT Duke of Saxony, Reigned 973-1011
2 CONT
2 CONT Preceded by 	Herman
2 CONT
2 CONT Succeeded by Bernard II
2 CONT
2 CONT Footnote:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Genealogie Mittelalter: Mittelalterliche Genealogie im Deutschen Reich bis zum Ende der Staufer:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.genealogie-mittelalter.de/sachsen/bernhard_1_herzog_von_sachsen_1011_billunger/bernhard_1_herzog_von_sachsen_+_1011.html
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Unattributed information in Norwegian(?):
2 CONT
2 CONT Another name for Bernhard was Bernhard of Saxony Billung. 
2 CONT
2 CONT General Notes: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Bernhard deltok med keiser Otto II i hans felttog mot Danmark i 974. Ved de tronstridigheter som oppsto etter Otto II's død 07.12.983, sto han på Otto III's side.
2 CONT
2 CONT Han var tilstede ved innvielsen av domkirken i St. Stephan i 992, oppholdt seg ofte ved hoffet og ble gjerne spurt om råd.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bernhard døde i klosteret Corvey hvor kong Heinrich II kort tid tidligere hadde ankommet. Han ble bisatt i kirken i klosteret St. Michaelis i Lüneburg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Noted events in his life were:
2 CONT
2 CONT • Acceded: Duke of Saxony, 973. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Bernhard married Hildegarde von Stade, daughter of Henrik I der Kahle of Stade and Hildegard. (Hildegarde von Stade was born between 974 and 976 and died on 3 Oct 1011.)
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Regjeringstid: Sachsen: 973 - 1011 
2 CONT
2 CONT Født: ca 950 
2 CONT
2 CONT Død: 1011 
2 CONT
2 CONT Foreldre: Hermann av Sachsen,
2 CONT
2 CONT mor ukjent 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ektefelle‍(r): bl.a. Hildegard av Stade 
2 CONT
2 CONT Barn: Herman
2 CONT
2 CONT Bernhard II av Sachsen
2 CONT
2 CONT Thietmar
2 CONT
2 CONT Mathildis
2 CONT
2 CONT Godesti
2 CONT
2 CONT Imma
2 CONT
2 CONT Othelinde 
2 CONT
2 CONT Bernhard I av Sachsen (født ca 950, død i Corvey i 1011) var en av hertug Herman Billungs sønner. Han etterfulgte sin far som hertug av Sachsen i 973. Bernhard støttet Liudolfingernes keisere og økte Billungenes makt i Saksen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bernhard var blant annet gift med Hildegard av Stade (-1011), datter av grev Henrik I den skallede, og hadde de følgende barna:
2 CONT
2 CONT Herman 
2 CONT
2 CONT Bernhard II av Sachsen (-1059) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thietmar (-1048) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mathildis (-1014), nonne i Gernrode 
2 CONT
2 CONT Godesti (-1041), abbedisse i Meteln og Herford 
2 CONT
2 CONT Imma, nonne i Herford 
2 CONT
2 CONT Othelinde (-1044), gift med grev Dirk III av Holland (-1039).
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
