2 CONT Otto I, Duke of Brunswick-Lüneburg
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT Otto married Matilda, daughter of Albert II, Margrave of Brandenburg, around 1228. They had the following known children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth (died 1266), married William II of Holland
2 CONT
2 CONT Helen (died 1273), married Albert II, Duke of Saxony and Hermann II, Landgrave of Thuringia
2 CONT
2 CONT Adelaide (died 1274), married Henry I, Landgrave of Hesse
2 CONT
2 CONT Matilda (died around 1295), married Henry II, Prince of Anhalt-Ascherleben
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes, married Wizlaw II, Duke of Rügen
2 CONT
2 CONT Albert (died 1279)
2 CONT
2 CONT John (died 1277)
2 CONT
2 CONT Otto, Bishop of Hildesheim (died 1279)
2 CONT
2 CONT Conrad, Bishop of Verden (died 1300)
