2 CONT Last Edited=3 Jun 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT      Sophie of Bohemia was the daughter of Friedrich, King of Bohemia and Elisabeth Arpád. (1) She married Albrecht Markgraf von Meißen, son of Otto Markgraf von Meißen and Hedwig von Brandenburg, on 23 April 1186 at Aussig. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 25 March 1195. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Sophie of Bohemia was a member of the House of Premysl.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Sophie of Bohemia and Albrecht Markgraf von Meißen
