2 CONT
2 CONT      Christine von Meißen was the daughter of Albrecht Markgraf von Meißen and Sophie of Bohemia. She married Hartmann von Lobdaburg-Bergau before 1216. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died after 1251.
2 CONT
2 CONT Forrás:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p905.htm#i9048
