2 CONT
2 CONT In 1222 Albert married Agnes of Austria (*1206–before 29 August 1238*) daughter of Duke Leopold VI of Austria
2 CONT
2 CONT Bernard (d. after 1238)
2 CONT
2 CONT Judith of Saxony, (1) ∞ 17 November 1239 King Eric IV of Denmark (*1216–1250*); and (2) ∞ Burchard VIII of Querfurt-Rosenburg, Burgrave of Magdeburg (1273–1313 recorded)
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann Mary (Anna Marie; d. 7 January 1245), ∞ Duke Barnim I of Pomerania
2 CONT
2 CONT Bridget (Brigitte Jutta) (d. 4 April 1266), fiancée of Otto of Brunswick and Lunenburg, ∞ before 1255 Margrave John I of Brandenburg [founder of the Johannean line Brandenburg-Stendal]
