1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 29522 Johann von Oeynhausen, Pawn Lord on Oldenburg in Schwalenberg, 1363-1403, born voor 1363, has died na 1403 zoon van Johann von Oeynhausen (zie 59044) en Kunigunde of Brobeck (zie 59045).
2 CONT   Gehuwd met 29523 Gertrud (Ghese) of Amelunxen, (from Borch).
2 CONT   Uit dit huwelijk:
2 CONT
2 CONT     1. Johann, born voor 1375, has died 1404th
2 CONT   Gehuwd met north of HAXTHAUSEN, dochter van Johann von HAXTHAUSEN, Lord of the Office Haxthausen, Lord on Borchen Hedemissen and Schwalenberg, Erbhofmeister to Paderborn, 1411-61, en Adele by Klencke.
2 CONT
2 CONT     2. Gertrud (zie 14761). Ref: [http://www.stangenberger.nl/genealogie/schoenberg/pg_00018.htm Stangerberger]
2 CONT
2 CONT The true surname of his mother should be von der Borch not Amelunxen as some sources claim.  This is evident on the coat of arms portraid on the epitaph of one of the descendants
