2 CONT * http://www.europeanheraldry.org/germany/princely-houses/house-nassau/ottonian-line/
2 CONT * https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stolberg-Wernigerode
2 CONT * https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/House_of_Stolberg
2 CONT
2 CONT =Sources=
