1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == DAME MARGARET BOYD [Note] Lady Rowallan ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''According to the Historie and Descent of the House of Rowallane, Margaret Boyd is: "daughter to Archibald Boyd of Bonschaw brother to Thomas master of Boyd who was forefault." [https://archive.org/stream/historiedescento1825mur
2 CONC e#page/74/mode/1up Historie, p. 74.]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''According to the Historie and Descent of the House of Rowallane, Margaret Boyd married John Mure of Rowallan: "He begat vpon her Mongo Mure who succeided, Alexr Mure of Ormshugh, Patrick & Adame. And daughteris the lady new-war
2 CONC k, secondly married to the laird of Barr, thirdlie vpon the gudman of Baldoone, ane other maried vpon the laird of Barr younger, The youngest vpon the laird of Sorbie in Galloway." [https://archive.org/stream/historiedescento1825m
2 CONC ure#page/74/mode/1up Historie, pp. 74-5]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Children ==
2 CONT
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Mungo-Mure-of-Rowallan/6000000000437966419?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1509898689974&through=6000000003159031610
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Patrick-Mure/6000000030039985351?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1509898923809&through=6000000003159031610
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Alexander-Mure-of-Ormshugh/6000000030039295745?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1509899596328&through=6000000048066469324
