1 NOTE Margaret Tudor (1489-1541), queen of Scotland, and daughter of King Henry 
2 CONT VII of England. She married King James IV of Scotland in 1503. In 1514, a 
2 CONT year after the king's death, she married Archibald Douglas, 6th earl of 
2 CONT Angus (1489-1557). Her great grandson, King James VI of Scotland, ascended 
2 CONT to the English throne as King James I in 1603.
1 NOTE Princess of England
1 NOTE Queen of Scotland and countess of Lennox.
