1 OCCU Konge af Danmark og Norge, Kung av Danmark och Norge 1559-1588, King of Denmark and Norway, Dansk kung 1559-, Konge av Danmark og Norge, Konge af Danmark - Norge, King of Denmark, count  of  OLDENBURG
1 TITL King of Denmark
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''FREDERIK II King of Denmark, King of Norway (Hadersleben 1 Jul 1534-Antvorskov 4 Apr 1588, bur Roskilde Cathedral)'''
2 CONT s/o CHRISTIAN III King of Denmark, King of Norway & Dorothea von Sachsen-Lauenburg
2 CONT x (Copenhagen 20 Jul 1572) SOPHIE von Mecklenburg-Güstrow
2 CONT *ELISABETH *ANNA *CHRISTIAN *ULRIK *JOHAN *AUGUSTA *HEDWIG
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/DENMARK.htm
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Links:==
2 CONT
2 CONT *[http://thepeerage.com/p10139.htm#i101382 The Peerage]
2 CONT *[http://www.geneall.net/W/per_page.php?id=3037 Geneall]
2 CONT *[http://www.danmarkskonger.dk/king39.htm Kings of Denmark]
