1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Anne Princess(Prinzessin)  of Brandenburg von Hohenzollern.
2 CONT
2 CONT By marriage Duchess(Herzogin)of  Mecklenburg-Güstrow
2 CONT
2 CONT Links:
2 CONT
