2 CONT View page 19 of 391
2 CONT
2 CONT THIS Margaretha von Altenbockum, daughter of Johann III von A. and Elisabeth von Hahn, married Wedig von Sacken. She is also sister to Peter von Altenbockum.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Margarethe who married Heinrich von Nettelhorst is the daughter of Peter von Altenbockum, and his wife Christina Knorre/ or Knorr
2 CONT Peter's page can be viewed at https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-CSPJ-5YS2?i=15&cat=325082
2 CONT view page 16 of 391, he is also on Tab 4.
2 CONT
2 CONT There are 2 Margarethe's, in 2 generations, and they are mistakenly connected here.
2 CONT Please investigate so this can be corrected.
2 CONT JF-Sept 1, 2024
