0 @N6000000008630680823@ NOTE : I3537 Name: Iii King Of Scotland Stewart JAMES Given Name: Iii King Of Scotland Stewart Surname: James 1 2 3 Sex: M Birth: 10 Jul 1451 in St. Andrew, Fife, Scotland Death: 11 Jun 1488 in Sauchieburn, Scotland Change Date: 18 Nov
