0 @N6000000002188039709@ NOTE Janet Kennedy
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Janet Kennedy (c. 1480 – c. 1545) was a mistress of King James IV of Scotland. They had three children, James Stewart, 1st Earl of Moray (1501 creation), and another two who died in infancy.
1 CONT
1 CONT Her father was John Kennedy, 2nd Lord Kennedy.
1 CONT
1 CONT She had three husbands, one of them was Archibald Douglas, 5th Earl of Angus.
