1 CONC tland.2 She married, secondly, Archibald Douglas, 6th Earl of Angus <p10149.htm>, son of George Douglas, Master of Angus <p10957.htm> and Elizabeth Drummond <p10957.htm>, on 4 August 1514 at Kinnoul Church.3,4 She married, thirdly
