1 CONC /28.1 She died on 18 October 1541 at age 51 from 'palsy'.5 She was buried at Carthusian Abbey of St. John, Perth, Perth & Kinross, Scotland.5  Through her marriage, Lady Margaret Tudor gained the title of Queen Consort Margaret of
